        "TileImage": "$($repository 62755855-8f3c-4588-bcc1-8c30ac5c8314).Image",
        "Description": "March 16, 2006, 9:50 AM, Bratislava, Slovakia. Good morning 47, your targets are now Ruben Fergerson, Angelo Gillispie, Elvis Lankford and Rosendo Hedlund. Eliminate all targets by contaminating ventilation system with lethal poison. After you eliminate all targets, then meet with Mária Pietrová and Lucas Grey in airport . Good luck 47!\rSources:\rhttps://medialne.trend.sk/televizia/blesk-degraduje-uroven-vlastnej-produkcie-stv",
